cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FiberTypeQC, please cite it using the metadata below, with the version you used."
title: "FiberTypeQC"
type: software
abstract: >-
  FiberTypeQC segments and fiber-types skeletal muscle immunofluorescence images, flags fibers
  that need checking, records reviewer corrections separately from model predictions, and
  produces auditable per-fiber and per-sample results.
authors:
  - given-names: James R.
    family-names: Conner
  - given-names: Felipe
    family-names: de Souza Leite
  - given-names: Louis M.
    family-names: Kunkel
repository-code: "https://github.com/jrconner16/fibertypeqc"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - skeletal muscle
  - fiber typing
  - image analysis
  - microscopy
  - quality control
  - napari
